      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Small field but solid race. Hard to go past AUXILIARY (1) who has been racing in richer company in Darwin. Back in trip but will be tough to stop. JUICE BOX (4) also tackled a tougher race last time when a close-up fourth. Nicely placed with the claim and is right in the mix. CHIEF WHITE SOCK (5) led throughout for a bug win last time over 1100m in Alice Springs. Freshened and will take catching again. LUNA FIELD (3) is racing well and is close to a win, the latest effort a solid second at Darwin over 1000m. Low draw and must be considered. VERBOSITY (2) was a fresh-up winner and fitter for it. Has to be included.",
